    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forks &amp; Daggers</strong> is a <strong>Medieval Social Deduction Game</strong> where players <strong>complete</strong> <strong>tasks</strong> like <strong>cooking</strong> and <strong>cleaning</strong> for the Lord, while hidden <strong>Assassins</strong> secretly <strong>poison food</strong>, <strong>kill others</strong>, and try to take over the manor. Serve or sabotage. Choose your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete tasks</strong> like <strong>cleaning</strong>, <strong>cooking</strong>, <strong>gathering</strong>, and repairing to please the Lord and <strong>survive</strong> each round. Fail to finish in time\u2026 and the Lord may send someone to the <strong>gallows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=778 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're chosen to be an <strong>Assassin (Daggers)</strong>, you can <strong>sneak</strong> around, <strong>fake tasks</strong>, <strong>poison food</strong>, and <strong>Eliminate servants</strong>,\u00a0all without getting caught. <strong>Stay hidden</strong>, <strong>act loyal</strong>, and <strong>strike</strong> when no one\u2019s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=730 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you <strong>die</strong>, you don\u2019t leave the game, you become a <strong>Rat</strong> that can <strong>spoil food</strong>, or a <strong>Cat</strong> that can <strong>hunt</strong> them, and <strong>help</strong> the <strong>Servants (Forks)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a <strong>Dagger Scroll</strong> as a servant? You can <strong>accept and become an Assassin (Dagger)</strong>, or refuse and risk being <strong>exposed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an <strong>Assassin (Dagger)</strong> and secretly <strong>poison ingredients</strong> or <strong>meals</strong> while acting like a normal servant. If the Lord eats it, you <strong>win</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>votes</strong> to decide who\u2019s suspicious. Hang the <strong>right person</strong> or let the real<strong> Assassin (Dagger)</strong> slip away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve or Sabotage</strong> \u2013 Be a loyal servant or a secret assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong> \u2013 Clean, cook, gather, and repair the manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poison the Food</strong> \u2013 Assassins can secretly poison ingredients or dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote &amp; Execute</strong> \u2013 Ring the bell and vote to hang the suspected traitor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convert Others</strong> \u2013 Drop a red scroll to recruit new assassins mid-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afterlife Roles</strong> \u2013 Play as a rat or cat after death to keep influencing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2013 Fail to finish tasks in time, and the Lord punishes someone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u201310 Player Online Party Game</strong> \u2013 Fun, chaos, and betrayal with friends or strangers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forks &amp; Daggers</strong> is a <strong>Medieval Social Deduction Game</strong> where players <strong>complete</strong> <strong>tasks</strong> like <strong>cooking</strong> and <strong>cleaning</strong> for the Lord, while hidden <strong>Assassins</strong> secretly <strong>poison food</strong>, <strong>kill others</strong>, and try to take over the manor. Serve or sabotage. Choose your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete tasks</strong> like <strong>cleaning</strong>, <strong>cooking</strong>, <strong>gathering</strong>, and repairing to please the Lord and <strong>survive</strong> each round. Fail to finish in time\u2026 and the Lord may send someone to the <strong>gallows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=778 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/478569aaac344efa41b0901ff4bebebd.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're chosen to be an <strong>Assassin (Daggers)</strong>, you can <strong>sneak</strong> around, <strong>fake tasks</strong>, <strong>poison food</strong>, and <strong>Eliminate servants</strong>,\u00a0all without getting caught. <strong>Stay hidden</strong>, <strong>act loyal</strong>, and <strong>strike</strong> when no one\u2019s watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=730 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/99bd2b0140f777e393ee8db29784d7e6.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you <strong>die</strong>, you don\u2019t leave the game, you become a <strong>Rat</strong> that can <strong>spoil food</strong>, or a <strong>Cat</strong> that can <strong>hunt</strong> them, and <strong>help</strong> the <strong>Servants (Forks)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/7a0851ae37baaff1c3bc8eba0fb66fe8.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a <strong>Dagger Scroll</strong> as a servant? You can <strong>accept and become an Assassin (Dagger)</strong>, or refuse and risk being <strong>exposed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/a809370c8287658e359e6ff47e0ccd9e.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an <strong>Assassin (Dagger)</strong> and secretly <strong>poison ingredients</strong> or <strong>meals</strong> while acting like a normal servant. If the Lord eats it, you <strong>win</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/6c00019437718863a2c6468c2015c2c1.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>votes</strong> to decide who\u2019s suspicious. Hang the <strong>right person</strong> or let the real<strong> Assassin (Dagger)</strong> slip away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.poster.avif?t=1754212298\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.webm?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/112afe4b23ffd93aae4d7fd053d25831.mp4?t=1754212298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve or Sabotage</strong> \u2013 Be a loyal servant or a secret assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong> \u2013 Clean, cook, gather, and repair the manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poison the Food</strong> \u2013 Assassins can secretly poison ingredients or dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote &amp; Execute</strong> \u2013 Ring the bell and vote to hang the suspected traitor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convert Others</strong> \u2013 Drop a red scroll to recruit new assassins mid-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afterlife Roles</strong> \u2013 Play as a rat or cat after death to keep influencing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2013 Fail to finish tasks in time, and the Lord punishes someone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u201310 Player Online Party Game</strong> \u2013 Fun, chaos, and betrayal with friends or strangers.</p></li></ul>",
